script: [
{ say: g.TQL[3] }, { pause: 3 },

{ say: g.TQL[55] }, { pause: 1 },
{ s: "A", t: "Good morning, everyone, and welcome to the Northfield Customer Service Summit. Before we begin, a few reminders." },
{ s: "A", t: "Today's sessions are being held on the second and third floors, and name badges are required to enter any room. If you haven't picked up your badge yet, please see the staff at the registration desk near the main entrance." },
{ s: "A", t: "Lunch will be served in the garden courtyard at twelve thirty, but if it rains, we'll move to the ballroom." },
{ s: "A", t: "Finally, please download the summit app, where you can view the schedule, rate each session, and message other attendees. Our first speaker, Dr. Hallett, will take the stage in ten minutes." },
{ pause: 6 },

{ say: g.TQL[15] }, { pause: 1 },
{ s: "B", t: "Hello, this message is for Mr. Okoro. It's Fiona from Saltwater Catering, returning your call about the retirement dinner on the twenty-eighth." },
{ s: "B", t: "Unfortunately, the lamb dish you asked for is no longer available because our supplier has stopped selling it. We can offer a roasted duck instead, which is a similar price." },
{ s: "B", t: "I'd also like to remind you that the final guest number is due a week before the event. Could you call me back at five-five-five, zero one four two by Tuesday so I can update the order?" },
{ s: "B", t: "If I don't hear from you, I'll go ahead with the duck. Thanks very much." },
{ pause: 6 },

{ say: g.TQL[53] }, { pause: 1 },
{ s: "C", t: "Tired of the same old lunch? Come to Basil and Brine, the newest restaurant on Waverly Street, where every dish is made with ingredients from local farms." },
{ s: "C", t: "This month, try our famous smoked-salmon bowl, or build your own salad from more than thirty fresh toppings. Our patio is now open, so you can enjoy your meal in the sunshine." },
{ s: "C", t: "And here's a special offer for listeners: mention this ad when you order any lunch special on a weekday, and you'll get a free drink." },
{ s: "C", t: "We're open every day from eleven until nine. Basil and Brine. Fresh food, close to home." },
{ pause: 6 },

{ say: "Questions 80 through 82 refer to the following talk." }, { pause: 1 },
{ s: "D", t: "Welcome to Aldermoor University's new student services building. I'm Gabriela, and I'll be your guide today." },
{ s: "D", t: "As we walk, you'll see that the ground floor houses the registrar's office and the financial aid center, which means you can handle most paperwork in one place. The second floor has quiet study rooms that you can reserve online up to a week in advance." },
{ s: "D", t: "We're about to enter the career center, where advisors help students find internships. Please be careful on the stairs, as the floor is being polished today. After the tour, we'll gather in the lobby, where free sandwiches are waiting." },
{ pause: 6 },

{ say: "Questions 83 through 85 refer to the following excerpt from a meeting and chart." }, { pause: 1 },
{ s: "E", t: "Thanks, everyone, for coming to the quarterly review. As you can see on the chart, our email campaigns for Dunmore Bikes brought in leads at the lowest cost, so we'll keep investing there." },
{ s: "E", t: "The channel I'm most surprised by is print, which cost more than three times as much per lead as email. That said, the client loves the glossy brochures, so we won't drop them just yet." },
{ s: "E", t: "Instead, we'll try a different approach on social video, which is currently the second most expensive channel. Our designers will test shorter clips next month." },
{ pause: 6 },

{ say: g.TQL[76] }, { pause: 1 },
{ s: "F", t: "In local news, residents of the Eastgate district are being asked to use less water this week after a pipe burst near Harrow Road on Sunday night." },
{ s: "F", t: "Water Authority crews have been working since early Monday to repair it, and they expect the job to be finished by Wednesday evening. Until then, water pressure may be low in some homes, and the authority has set up free bottled water stations at the Eastgate Library and the Hillcrest Community Center." },
{ s: "F", t: "Customers who experience a total loss of water should call the authority's help line. It's open twenty-four hours a day. Now, over to Ben with the traffic report." },
{ pause: 6 },

{ say: "Questions 89 through 91 refer to the following recorded message." }, { pause: 1 },
{ s: "G", t: "Thank you for calling Ridgeway Transit. Due to track maintenance, Blue Line trains will not run between Harbor Station and Lincoln Park this weekend." },
{ s: "G", t: "Free shuttle buses will take passengers between the two stations, but please allow an extra twenty minutes for your trip. Weekly pass holders do not need to buy additional tickets." },
{ s: "G", t: "To hear about changes to bus routes, press one. To check the status of an elevator at a station, press two. To speak with a customer service representative, please stay on the line. Our offices are open Monday through Friday, from eight until six." },
{ pause: 6 },

{ say: "Questions 92 through 94 refer to the following speech." }, { pause: 1 },
{ s: "H", t: "Good evening, everyone, and thank you for joining us for the Open Hands Foundation's annual dinner. Tonight, I'd like to honor someone who has given more than a thousand hours to our food bank over the past six years." },
{ s: "H", t: "Margaret Ellison started as a weekend packer, and she now runs our entire volunteer program. Thanks to her, the number of volunteers has doubled, and we've been able to deliver meals to nearly two thousand additional families." },
{ s: "H", t: "Margaret, would you please come up to receive this award? And after the applause, I invite everyone to visit the dessert table, where our sponsors have prepared a special surprise." },
{ pause: 6 },

{ say: "Questions 95 through 97 refer to the following announcement and departure board." }, { pause: 1 },
{ s: "I", t: "Attention, passengers. Because of a signal problem, the train scheduled to leave from Platform six at ten fifty-five has been canceled." },
{ s: "I", t: "Passengers holding tickets for that service may use the next departure to the same destination, which leaves at twelve fifteen, or request a full refund at the ticket office." },
{ s: "I", t: "All other trains are running on time. Please be aware that Platform two is closed for cleaning, so passengers for that platform should follow the signs to the temporary waiting area near the main entrance." },
{ s: "I", t: "Free water is available at the information desk. We apologize for any inconvenience." },
{ pause: 6 },

{ say: "Questions 98 through 100 refer to the following telephone message." }, { pause: 1 },
{ s: "J", t: "Hi, this is Tamara from the Lakeview Lodge, returning your call about booking the lodge for your company's training retreat in October. I'm happy to say we have availability for the weekend of the eleventh." },
{ s: "J", t: "The group rate is ninety-five dollars per room, and that includes breakfast. However, the meeting room with the projector is already reserved on Saturday, so you'd need to use the smaller room in the west wing. Would that work for you?" },
{ s: "J", t: "I'll hold the rooms until the end of this week, so please let me know before then. Oh, and by the way, our new shuttle can pick up your group from the airport." },
{ pause: 6 },
],
